        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9168, Elegant Vintage Collection Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nElegant in design, this cabinet knob is made of solid brass. Having just enough detail to make it an interesting embellishment to any home design, this Elegant Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob easily blends in with almost any decor. The Elegant Vintage Collection Cabinet Knob is available in 3 finishes, all of which grant the knob the vintage look of naturally weathered metal. Choose from 3 sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available the <a href=\"/products/elegant-cabinet-knob-omnia-9168\"><b>Omnia 9168 Elegant Cabinet Knob</b></a> in other finishes and other <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Vintage Collection Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 9168 Elegant Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9168/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9168/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9168/35</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
